title: ApplicationNotes

The example tiddler  '''contextmenu example''' must have a field called `applicationtype` set to `ex1contextmenu` which is used in

$:/bj/example/view/cascade 

to select the template

$:/bj/ex1contextmenu/ViewTemplate

which contain the context menu widget

----
The context menu widget is configured to use the menu tiddler [[ex1MenuTable]] whose rule tid [[WordRefDo]] opens the modal tiddler [[WordRefModal]] with the selected text
